    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24620" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαγκῠλόομαι</span></b> , Dep., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκύλη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold a javelin by the thong</i>:—only pf.
